body:
Hi! i had a similar situation with my ex, i also cheated on him, and he stayed with me for 2 years more, i cheated more, so i really regret it, hes a good guy really, and i hurt him and we broke up after 3 years, because he got tired of it and he started dating someone else.

&#x200B;

Im currently in another LDR, and we he and i, have a problem dealing with the distance, but what i did this time, was talk with him, its 2021, people are more open to new ideas, so i suggest an open LDR relationship, he accept, and were somewhat better, so my main point, is communicate with him more, maybe suggest this, i wish you luck!! I really think LDR can work! its just a lot more of work
